author=litoxperaloca
description=Every local character (split-screen included) gets a starter kit once: an army ALICE pack worn on the back holding a shotgun and 4 boxes of shells, machete, crowbar, hammer, screwdriver, bolt cutters, blowtorch, welding mask, wood axe, saw, box of nails, rope, torch, a full canteen and 4 bandages. Anything that does not fit goes to the main inventory, and nothing you are already wearing is ever replaced. Each group - backpack, weapons, tools, survival - can be switched off in Options - MODS. Recorded per character: reloading never duplicates it, a new character gets it again. Built for couch co-op runs where you want to skip the scavenging opening. EN/ES.
